{"ID":"20240206113621-7hpqz42","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206113621-7hpqz42","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113621-7hpqz42\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113630-yownt58\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620081320-xsfmn8j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1785,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619173135-laockr9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"鸡屎藤（鸡矢藤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903092710"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113630-yownt58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113630-yownt58","updated":"20240206113634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产长江流域及其以南各地。\n【性状】\t鸡矢藤茎呈扁圆柱形，稍扭曲，无毛或近无毛，老黄牛茎灰棕色，直径312mm，栓皮常脱落，有纵皱纹及叶柄断痕，易折断，断面平坦，灰黄色；嫩茎黑褐色，直径13mm，质韧，不易折断，断面纤维性，灰白色或浅绿色。叶对生，多皱缩或破碎，完整者展平后呈宽卵形或披针形，长515cm，宽26cm，先端尖，基部楔形，圆形或浅心形，全缘，绿褐色，两面无柔毛或近无毛；叶柄长1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7cm，无毛或有毛。聚伞花序顶生或腋生，前者多带叶，后者疏散少花，花序轴及花均被疏柔毛，花淡紫色。气特异，味微苦、涩。\n【性味】\t甘、酸，平。\n【功效】\t祛风除湿；消食化积；解毒消肿；活血止痛。主治风湿痹痛；食积腹胀；小儿疳积；腹泻；痢疾；中暑；黄疸；肝炎；肝脾肿大；咳嗽；瘰疬；肠痈；无名肿毒；脚湿肿烂；烫火伤；湿疹；皮炎；跌打损伤；蛇蛟蝎螫。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113624-p9avv2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113624-p9avv2q","updated":"20240206113624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113624-zxi4al3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730143512-mu7wqnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730143512-mu7wqnt","updated":"20240730144319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 453px;","style":"width: 443px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤-20240730143512-vlg2v7q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 443px;\" parent-style=\"width: 453px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 1-20240730144032-nz534xr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 311px;\" parent-style=\"width: 321px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 396px;","style":"width: 386px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 2-20240730144045-l93bny2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 386px;\" parent-style=\"width: 396px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730144516-921jsfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730144516-921jsfr","updated":"20240730144516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 575px;","style":"width: 565px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡矢藤5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡矢藤5-20240620081332-kwj07ja.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 565px;\" parent-style=\"width: 575px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡矢藤4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡矢藤4-20240620081322-ypiq2nc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730144304-r37exms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730144304-r37exms","updated":"20240730144342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 555px;","style":"width: 545px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡矢藤6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡矢藤6-20240620081353-3739k4o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 545px;\" parent-style=\"width: 555px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 555px;","style":"width: 545px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 4-20240730144342-vaj0u4t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 545px;\" parent-style=\"width: 555px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730145557-0pteagn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730145557-0pteagn","updated":"20240730145651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 640px;","style":"width: 630px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 12-20240730145557-d4kiji8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 630px;\" parent-style=\"width: 640px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 544px;","style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 13-20240730145651-pt6lnav.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\" parent-style=\"width: 544px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730145346-nwm56vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730145346-nwm56vh","updated":"20240730145521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 11-20240730145521-4poomn8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 756px;","style":"width: 746px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 10-20240730145346-wjph15e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 746px;\" parent-style=\"width: 756px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730144032-ytbnmep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730144032-ytbnmep","updated":"20240730145256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 326px;","style":"width: 316px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 5-20240730144551-6bzolmm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 316px;\" parent-style=\"width: 326px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 431px;","style":"width: 421px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 6-20240730144725-hbr5676.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 421px;\" parent-style=\"width: 431px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡屎藤 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡屎藤 9-20240730145256-063tpqs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730143827-xt5wj5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730143827-xt5wj5i","updated":"20240730143932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：鸡屎藤叶对生，卵形或披针形，有时心状形，叶上面五毛，茎上无毛或近无毛；"}]},{"ID":"20240730144555-tosv2fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730144555-tosv2fl","updated":"20240730144625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：鸡屎藤揉搓叶片会散发一种鸡屎的臭味，其名由此而来；"}]},{"ID":"20240730145141-e95e7ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730145141-e95e7ty","updated":"20240730145203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三注：鸡屎藤有小叶、大叶之分，以上取图未分类；"}]},{"ID":"20240620081320-xsfmn8j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240620081320-xsfmn8j"}},{"ID":"20240903092703-5sfvvu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-5sfvvu4","updated":"20240903092710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：鸡屎藤"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-q8v7slb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-q8v7slb","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡屎藤《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-8jpnurj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-8jpnurj","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《生草药性备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-e7z8l5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-e7z8l5i","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīShǐTénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-f2gxjg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-f2gxjg7","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】斑鸩饭、女青、主屎藤（《质问本草》），却节（《李氏草秘》），皆治藤、臭藤根（《纲目拾遗》），牛皮冻（《植物名实图考》），臭藤（《天宝本草》），毛葫芦（《岭南采药录》），甜藤（《广西中兽医药植》），五香藤、臭狗藤（《民间常用草药汇编》），香藤、母狗藤（《四川中药志》），鸡矢藤（《上海常用中草药》），清风藤（《福建中草药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-9wu78o7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-9wu78o7","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为茜草科植物鸡屎藤的全草及根。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-p76o2wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-p76o2wu","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】蔓生草本，基部木质，高2～3米，秃净或稍被微毛。叶对生，有柄；叶片近膜质，卵形、椭圆形、矩圆形至披针形，先端短尖或渐尖，基部浑圆或楔尖，两面均秃净或近秃净；叶间托叶三角形，长2～5毫米，脱落。圆锥花序腋生及顶生，扩展，分枝为蝎尾状的聚伞花序；花白紫色，无柄；萼狭钟状，长约3毫米；花冠钟状，花筒长7～10毫米，上端5裂，镊合状排列，内面红紫色，被粉状柔毛；雄蕊5，花丝极短，着生于花冠筒内；子房下位，2室，花柱丝状，2枚，基部愈合。浆果球形，直径5～7毫米，成熟时光亮，草黄色。花期秋季。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-3h3czph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-3h3czph","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于溪边、河边、路边、林旁及灌木林中，常攀援于其他植物或岩石上。分布山东、安徽、江苏、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、广东、广西、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ec8lykc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ec8lykc","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-02tbn26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-02tbn26","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"含鸡屎藤甙、鸡屎藤次甙、车叶草甙等环臭蚁醛类化合物及γ-谷甾醇。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-gbka640","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-gbka640","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶含熊果酚甙0.86％及挥发油等。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-rd7k8k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-rd7k8k9","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】鸡屎藤水煎馏液对小鼠有明显镇痛作用（热板法）。腹腔注射0.01毫升／克体重，即可提高痛阚，维持时间较长。其注射液与吗啡相比，开始较慢而持续较久。其醇制剂对麻醉动物（猫、兔及犬）有降压作用。印度产鸡屎藤提取物在体外试验有可的松样作用，而注入兔关节腔，可降低炎症病变；全草煎剂给大鼠口服共10天，对甲醛性\"关节炎\"有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-u0cw6pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-u0cw6pr","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-8nobksb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-8nobksb","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-tscoya4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-tscoya4","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《岭南采药录》：\"味辛苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-kkyxwb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-kkyxwb6","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《上海常用中草药》：\"甘酸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-evjqbu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-evjqbu9","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-6ailkrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-6ailkrz","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"祛风活血，止痛解毒，消食导滞，除湿消肿。治风湿疼痛，腹泻痢疾，肮腹疼痛，气虚浮肿，头昏食少，肝脾肿大，瘰疬，肠痈，无名肿毒，跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-uaq3uc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-uaq3uc3","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①汪连仕《采药书》：\"治风痛肠痈，跌打损伤，流注风火瘴毒，散郁气。洗疝，合紫苏煎汤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ipczul6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ipczul6","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《李氏草秘》：\"煎洗腿足诸风，寒湿痛，拘挛不能转舒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-b2m20ij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-b2m20ij","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《生草药性备要》：\"其头治新内伤，煲肉食，补虚益肾，除火补血；洗疮止痛，消热散毒。其叶擂米加糖食，止痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-3o9mwjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-3o9mwjc","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目拾遗》：\"中暑者以根、叶作粉食之。虚损者杂猪胃煎服。\"\"治瘰疬用.裉煎酒，未破者消，已溃者敛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-55wkm4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-55wkm4w","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草求原》：\"理脚湿肿烂，蛇伤，同米擂食并敷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-x4u6ss3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-x4u6ss3","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《植物名实图考》：\"为洗药，解毒，去风，清热，散寒。\"\"敷无名肿毒，并补筋骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-yl06ger","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-yl06ger","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《草木便方》：\"补虚劳，调理脾胃元气，治病后虚肿、耳鸣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-5jbqh56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-5jbqh56","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《四川中药志》：\"治失眠，久咳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-8agyafu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-8agyafu","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《重庆草药》：\"健脾除湿，益气补虚。常用于小儿瘦弱，脾弱气虚，食积疳积，及成人气虚浮肿，臌胀，耳呜，腹泻，遗尿，妇女虚弱白带，干病。并虚弱劳伤，虚痢，痒子瘰疬之由于气虚不愈者。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-aajgsa6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-aajgsa6","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩《上海常用中草药》：\"祛风，活血，止痛，消肿。治风湿酸痛，跌打损伤，肝脾肿大，无名肿毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-3p7k7jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-3p7k7jw","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱（大剂量1～2两）；或浸酒。外用：捣敷或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-w9p93lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-w9p93lc","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-gv9h48m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-gv9h48m","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治气郁胸闷，胃痛：鸡屎藤根一至二两。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-x3uyntr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-x3uyntr","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治食积腹泻：鸡屎藤一两。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-dwsavo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-dwsavo8","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小儿疳积：鸡屎藤干根五钱，猪小肚一个。水炖服。（①方以下出《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-cvczf37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-cvczf37","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治妇女虚弱咳嗽，白带腹胀：鸡屎藤根四两，红小芭煎头四两。炖鸡服。（《重庆草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-fs6gw99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-fs6gw99","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治红痢：鸡屎藤根四两，路边姜二两。炖肉服。（《重庆草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-nmcu1ib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-nmcu1ib","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小儿脱肛：皆治藤近根之头，老者，酒蒸晒十次，和羊肠煮食之。（《岭南采药录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-um7oj4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-um7oj4q","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治关节风湿痛：鸡屎藤根或藤一至二两。酒水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ldgt3yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ldgt3yo","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治阑尾炎：鲜鸡屎藤根或茎叶一至二两。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-1zujtl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-1zujtl8","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治背疽：鲜鸡屎藤二两，酒水煎服；渣或另用鲜叶捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ycejfev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ycejfev","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治跌打损伤：鸡屎藤根、藤一两。酒水煎服。（⑧方以下出《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-qu0xbzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-qu0xbzr","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治有机磷农药中毒：鸡屎藤三两，绿豆一两。水煎成三大杯，先服一大杯，二至三小时服一次。药后有呕吐腹泻反应。（《单方验方调查资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-njj72v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-njj72v4","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-yh42vdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-yh42vdc","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①止痛"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-1lglwzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-1lglwzd","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取鲜鸡矢藤制成注射液，每毫升相当于生药5克。肌肉注射，每次2～5毫升，4小时后可重复用药或连续用药。适用于胃肠疼痛，胆、肾绞痛，各种外伤、骨折、手术后疼痛，神经痛等。治疗537例，疼痛消失328例，减轻197例，无效12例，有效率为97.7％。如将注射液加入10％葡萄糖液行痛点或穴位注射，可以治疗腰腿痛。实践中观察到，药物气味越浓，止痛效果越好，有些患者用药后，从呼气和尿中能闻到鸡矢藤味，可能因鸡矢藤有效成分为一种挥发性物质，由呼吸道和尿排出之故。注射时对局部有轻微刺激痛，加入适量普鲁卡因液可减轻；少数病人用量过大有头昏感，余无其他副作用。此外，亦可将鸡矢藤切碎用米酒浸泡7天，每次5～10毫升，日服3次，用于胃肠痉挛性疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-3n2y41f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-3n2y41f","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗神经性皮炎等皮肤病"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-jlj0fd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-jlj0fd1","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以鸡屎藤叶或嫩芽擦患处，每次5分钟，每日2～3次。11例神经性皮炎治疗后痊愈8例，好转3例；5例湿疹，10例周身瘙痒症，均治愈。治愈时间一般7天左右，短者2～3天，长者需2～3月。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-0u56gqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-0u56gqj","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗慢性骨髓炎"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-uos6bye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-uos6bye","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以牛皮消（即鸡矢藤）1两（鲜），红孩儿5钱，加红糖适量，每日煎服2次。同时用牛皮消叶、水莽根、麻兜适量，加少量食盐捣烂外敷，每天1次；创口脓尽后换用冰片、牛皮消粉外敷。观察10例，病程最长者20年，最短者5个月；结果8例痊愈，近期控制1例，好转1例。见效最快者2周，症状改善最迟者2月。内服无显著副作用及毒性反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ivxqfcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ivxqfcb","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗瘤型麻风反应"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-seym59d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-seym59d","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用鸡屎藤叶茎1000克加水过药面蒸馏，取蒸馏液1000毫升按制剂规程制成静脉注射液，每日静脉注射1次，每次30～50毫升，2～5天为一疗程，发高热时可用鸡屎藤60毫升加10％葡萄糖液200毫升静脉滴注。治疗中、晚期瘤型麻风反应37例，显效（用药第五天反应症状、体征完全消失）25例，好转（反应症状明显减轻、体温恢复正常）7例，无效5例。此药具有消炎利水作用，对麻风的关节反应、淋巴反应有较好疗效，对结节性红斑反应及神经痛疗效较差。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-6wbqbev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-6wbqbev","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-vq4sxsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-vq4sxsj","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡屎藤《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-r1s53ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-r1s53ch","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《生草药性备要》。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-uoemabq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-uoemabq","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīShǐTénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-iulourz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-iulourz","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】ChineseFevervineHerb，HerbofChineseFevervine"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ti7gocc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ti7gocc","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】斑鸠饭、女青、主屎藤、却节、皆治藤、臭藤根、牛皮冻、鸡矢藤、臭藤、毛葫芦、甜藤、五香藤、臭狗藤、香藤、母狗藤、白毛藤、狗屁藤、清风藤、臭屎藤、鸡脚藤、解暑藤、玉明砂、鸡屙藤、雀儿藤"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-jlva3u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-jlva3u0","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-t2moc1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-t2moc1s","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为双子叶植物药茜草科植物鸡屎藤的全草及根。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-0wf6e5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-0wf6e5s","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Paederiascandens(Lour.)Merr."}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-bgniaxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-bgniaxg","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：在栽后9-10月除留种的外，每年都可割取地上部分，晒或凉干即成。或秋季挖根，洗净，切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-4l9r4hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-4l9r4hr","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草质藤本，长3-5m。基部木质，多分枝。叶对生；叶柄长1.5-7cm；托叶三角表，长2-3mm，早落；叶片卵形椭圆形、长圆形至披针形，长5-15cm，宽1-6cm，先端急尖至渐尖，基部宽楔形，两面无毛或下面稍被短柔毛；叶纸质，新鲜揉之有臭气。聚伞花序排成顶生的带叶的大圆锥花序或腋生而疏散少花；花紫色，几无梗；萼狭钟状；花冠简长7-10mm，先端5裂，镊合状排列，内面红紫色，被粉状柔毛；雄蕊5；子房下位，2室。浆果球形，直径5-7mm，成熟时光亮，草黄色。花期7-8月，果期9-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-zue5642","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-zue5642","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ptifqpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ptifqpd","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于溪边、河边、路边、林旁及灌木林中，常攀援于其他植物或岩石上。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-tfewhmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-tfewhmt","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于山东、安徽、江苏、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、广东、广西、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-m1bsy2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-m1bsy2f","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-cev76ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-cev76ui","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.气候土壤：喜温暖湿润的环境。土壤以肥沃、深厚、湿润的砂质壤土较好。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-iq36kl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-iq36kl1","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.种植：。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-pm7voxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-pm7voxc","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.种子繁殖：3-4月按行、株距各约33cm开穴，深约7cm，每穴播种子10粒左右，浇人、畜粪水后，覆盖草木灰或细土约1cm厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-klvig5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-klvig5v","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.扦插繁殖：2-3月选2年生的老茎藤，剪成20-30cm长，有3节以上的插条，在畦上按行、株距各约30cm开穴，深20-25cm，每穴波插条3根，每根要有1个芽节露出畦面，填土压紧，注意浇水，保持土壤湿润。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-l3dpduk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-l3dpduk","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.种子发芽后，当苗高7-10cm时匀苗、补苗，每穴留苗2-3株，结合中耕除草，追施人畜粪水。藤长30cm左右时，再中耕除草、追肥1次，同时插设支柱，以供攀援。9-10月收割后，再行中耕除草，追肥1次过冬。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-rtcbzed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-rtcbzed","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.病虫害防治：虫害有蚜虫，可用乐果防治。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-58czv69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-58czv69","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-bj74bvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-bj74bvs","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别鸡矢藤茎呈扁圆柱形，稍扭曲，无毛或近无毛，老黄牛茎灰棕色，直径3-12mm，栓皮常脱落，有纵皱纹及叶柄断痕，易折断，断面平坦，灰黄色；嫩茎黑褐色，直径1-3mm，质韧，不易折断，断面纤维性，灰白色或浅绿色。叶对生，多皱缩或破碎，完整者展平后呈宽卵形或披针形，长5-15cm，宽2-6cm，先端尖，基部楔形，圆形或浅心形，全缘，绿褐色，两面无柔毛或近无毛；叶柄长1.5-7cm，无毛或有毛。聚伞花序顶生或腋生，前者多带叶，后者疏散少花，花序轴及花均被疏柔毛，花淡紫色。气特异，味微苦、涩。以条匀、叶多、气浓者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-e09vj1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-e09vj1h","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别幼茎横切面：呈扁圆形，表表细胞1列，外壁稍增厚，被角质层；有的可见非腺毛残基。皮层7-8列细胞，外侧1-2列为厚角细胞，维管束外韧型。韧皮部有没细胞，韧皮部外侧有纤维，单个或数个成群继续热电厂列成环，壁非木化。木质部导管常数个至十数个相聚成12-14个导管群，木纤维发达，木薄壁细胞稀少。髓部较大，呈长圆形。本品薄壁细胞含草酸钙针晶。老茎横切面：呈圆形，韧皮部外侧可见木栓层，木质部呈圆形环，髓部扁圆形，略偏心形。叶横切面：表皮细胞1列，外被角质层，有非腺毛，长50-500μm由3-5个细胞组成，壁上有角质层纹理，栅栏细胞1列，海绵组织中有大型含晶细胞，针晶束长约140μm。主脉的上面微凸起，下面呈弧形突出，上、下表皮内方均有厚角组织。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-1jx3ny2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-1jx3ny2","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶表面观：表皮细胞多角形，垂周壁较平直，平周壁有明显角质层纹理。上、下表皮均有平轴式气孔，副卫细胞2个。草酸钙针晶束较我，长达150μm。叶脉部分常有非腺毛分布，长50-500μm，由3-15个细胞组成，壁具角质层纹理。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-hh355fc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-hh355fc","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】全株含环烯醚萜甙类(iridoidglrcoside)；鸡屎藤甙(paederoside)，鸡屎藤次甙(scandoside)，鸡屎藤甙酸(paederosideacid)，车叶草甙(as-peruloside)，去乙酰车叶草甙(deacetylasperuloside)。还含矢车菊素糖甙(cyanidinglyco-side)，矮牵牛素糖甙(betunidinglycoside)，蹄纹天竺素(pelargonidin)，摁贝素(embelin)及一饱和羰基混合物。叶中含熊果酚甙(arbutin)，挥发油，C10-表叶绿素(C10-epichlorophyll)和脱镁叶绿素(pheo-phytin)"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-wt75pv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-wt75pv4","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-qbpzdiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-qbpzdiw","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.镇痛：鸡屎藤注射液10-30ml/kg腹腔注射，小鼠热板法试验有镇痛作用。鸡屎藤蒸馏液100：1浓缩液10-30ml/kg腹腔注射对小鼠电刺激法有镇痛作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-u5z6zt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-u5z6zt9","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗惊厥：鸡屎藤蒸馏液对戊四唑引起的小鼠惊厥有抑制作用，并降低死亡鼠数。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-pijzxm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-pijzxm9","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘酸；平"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-7bnufag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-7bnufag","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】心；肝；脾；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-crgt4f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-crgt4f1","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风除湿；消食化积；解毒消肿；活血止痛。主治风湿痹痛；食积腹胀；小儿疳积；腹泻；痢疾；中暑；黄疸；肝炎；肝脾肿大；咳嗽；瘰疬；肠痈；无名肿毒；脚湿肿烂；烫火伤；湿疹；皮炎；跌打损伤；蛇蛟蝎螫"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-mxynb68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-mxynb68","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，10-15g，大剂30-60；或浸酒。外用：捣敷，或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-xpl1fme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-xpl1fme","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-ac6spm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-ac6spm9","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.汪连仕《采药书》：治风痛肠痈，跌打损伤，流注风火虫毒，散郁气。洗疝，合紫苏煎汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-p8cbl21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-p8cbl21","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《李氏草秘》：煎洗腿足诸风，寒湿痛，拘挛不能转舒。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-mb0lf9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-mb0lf9x","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《生草药性备要》：其头治新内伤，煲肉食，补虚益肾，除火补血；洗疮止痛，消热散毒。其叶擂米加糖食，止痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-owjr99p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-owjr99p","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草纲目拾遗》：中暑者以根、叶作粉食之。虚损者杂猪胃煎服。治瘰疬用根煎酒，未破者消，已溃者敛。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-trxynnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-trxynnn","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草求原》：理脚湿肿烂，蛇伤，同米擂食并敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-1aw7kzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-1aw7kzt","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《植物名实图考》：为洗药、解毒，去风，清热，散寒。敷无名肿毒，并补筋骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-l5golxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-l5golxr","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《草木便方》：补虚劳，调理脾胃元气，治病后虚肿、耳鸣。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-d52rhbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-d52rhbk","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.四川中药志》：治失眠，久咳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-f1shn7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-f1shn7n","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《重庆草药》：健脾除湿，益气补虚。常用于小儿瘦弱，脾弱气虚，食积疳积，及成人气虚浮肿，臌胀，耳鸣，腹泻，遗尿，妇女虚弱白带，干病。并虚弱劳伤，虚痢，痒子瘰疬之由于气虚不愈者。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-v8uquln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-v8uquln","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《上海常用中草药》：祛风，活血，止痛，消肿。治风湿酸痛，跌打损伤，肝脾肿大，无名肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092703-3kcccgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092703-3kcccgf","updated":"20240903092732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092704-liepiy5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240903092704-liepiy5","updated":"20240903092732"}},{"ID":"20240903092705-6p0ocg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092705-6p0ocg2","updated":"20240903092732"}}]}